    "number": 88,
    "summary": "A prayer of one who feels forsaken and who asks whether the Lord’s loving kindness will be declared in the grave.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "O Lord God of my salvation, I have cried day and night before thee:",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 45,
            "end": 48
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 1,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 88:1",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 88,
        "verse": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "Let my prayer come before thee: incline thine ear unto my cry;",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 88:2",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 88,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "For my soul is full of troubles: and my life draweth nigh unto the grave.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 88:3",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 88,
        "verse": 3
      },
      {
        "text": "I am counted with them that go down into the pit: I am as a man that hath no strength:",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 45,
            "end": 48,
            "text": "Ps. 28:1; 143:7; 2 Ne. 24:15."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 64,
            "end": 73
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 4,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Ps. 28:1; 143:7; 2 Ne. 24:15.",
            "prettyString": "Psalms 28:1; 143:7; 2 Nephi 24:15",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "psalms",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 28,
                    "end": 28,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 1,
                        "end": 1
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "start": 143,
                    "end": 143,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 7,
                        "end": 7
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "2nephi",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 24,
                    "end": 24,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 15,
                        "end": 15
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 88:4",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 88,
        "verse": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "Free among the dead, like the slain that lie in the grave, whom thou rememberest no more: and they are cut off from thy hand.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 69,
            "end": 80,
            "text": "Ps. 31:12."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 5,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Ps. 31:12.",
            "prettyString": "Psalms 31:12",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "psalms",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 31,
                    "end": 31,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 12,
                        "end": 12
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 88:5",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 88,
        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "Thou hast laid me in the lowest pit, in darkness, in the deeps.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 6,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 88:6",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 88,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "Thy wrath lieth hard upon me, and thou hast afflicted me with all thy waves. Selah.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 54,
            "end": 56
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 88:7",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 88,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "Thou hast put away mine acquaintance far from me; thou hast made me an abomination unto them: I am shut up, and I cannot come forth.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 94,
            "end": 98
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 88:8",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 88,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "Mine eye mourneth by reason of affliction: Lord, I have called daily upon thee, I have stretched out my hands unto thee.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 5,
            "end": 8,
            "text": "Ps. 38:10."
          },
          {
            "start": 31,
            "end": 41,
            "text": "TG Affliction."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Ps. 38:10.",
            "prettyString": "Psalms 38:10",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "psalms",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 38,
                    "end": 38,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 10,
                        "end": 10
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "raw": "TG Affliction.",
            "prettyString": "TG Affliction",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "studyHelp",
                "studyHelpType": "tg",
                "title": "Affliction",
                "entryId": "tg-affliction",
                "book": "",
                "chapters": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 88:9",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 88,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "Wilt thou shew wonders to the dead? shall the dead arise and praise thee? Selah.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 57,
            "end": 60
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 88:10",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 88,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "Shall thy lovingkindness be declared in the grave? or thy faithfulness in destruction?",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 51,
            "end": 53
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 88:11",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 88,
        "verse": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "Shall thy wonders be known in the dark? and thy righteousness in the land of forgetfulness?",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 12,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 88:12",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 88,
        "verse": 12
      },
      {
        "text": "But unto thee have I cried, O Lord; and in the morning shall my prayer prevent thee.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 71,
            "end": 83,
            "text": "HEB come before Thy face."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 13,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 88:13",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 88,
        "verse": 13
      },
      {
        "text": "Lord, why castest thou off my soul? why hidest thou thy face from me?",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 40,
            "end": 46,
            "text": "2 Sam. 11:27 (1–27); 12:11 (1–25); 1 Chr. 21:8 (1–8)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 36,
            "end": 39
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 14,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 88:14",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 88,
        "verse": 14
      },
      {
        "text": "I am afflicted and ready to die from my youth up: while I suffer thy terrors I am distracted.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 2,
            "end": 4
          },
          {
            "start": 37,
            "end": 39
          },
          {
            "start": 50,
            "end": 55
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 15,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 88:15",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 88,
        "verse": 15
      },
      {
        "text": "Thy fierce wrath goeth over me; thy terrors have cut me off.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 16,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 88:16",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 88,
        "verse": 16
      },
      {
        "text": "They came round about me daily like water; they compassed me about together.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 17,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 88:17",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 88,
        "verse": 17
      },
      {
        "text": "Lover and friend hast thou put far from me, and mine acquaintance into darkness.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 44,
            "end": 47
          }
        ],
